#. translators: %s: Babilim support email address. Do not translate or change it.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1949
#, php-format
msgid "Babilim is set to erase this site's identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to this site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data on uninstall\" in the Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"
msgstr "Babilim está configurado para borrar a identidade deste sitio cando se elimine o complemento. Entón a licenza de pago asociada a este sitio non se poderá restaurar automaticamente; terías que contactar coa asistencia de Babilim en %s. Para manter a identidade, preme Cancelar, desmarca \"Eliminar todos os datos de Babilim ao desinstalar\" na configuración de Babilim e desactiva de novo. Desactivar igualmente?"

#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:348
#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:939
#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:1271
msgid "Babilim ran out of time for this step and will continue on the next check."
msgstr "Babilim esgotou o tempo para este paso e continuará na próxima comprobación."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3827
msgid "Babilim settings"
msgstr "Axustes de Babilim"

#. translators: %s: the date and time syncing is expected to resume.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1622
#, php-format
msgid "Babilim sync is temporarily delayed by the service (rate limited); it will try again after %s."
msgstr "O servizo atrasou temporalmente a sincronización de Babilim (límite de solicitudes); volverá intentalo despois de %s."

#: includes/class-babilim-upload.php:191
msgid "Babilim was updated while this upload was waiting. The old package was discarded; please confirm the upload again."
msgstr "Babilim actualizouse mentres esta subida estaba en espera. O paquete antigo descartouse; confirma a subida de novo."

#. translators: 1: plugin or theme name, 2: its version number.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3428
#, php-format
msgid "Babilim will upload these files from %1$s (version %2$s): every .php and .js file, every block.json file, and the readme.txt, readme.md, style.css and theme.json in its main folder. They are used to find the text that needs translating and to identify the plugin or theme."
msgstr "Babilim subirá estes arquivos de %1$s (versión %2$s): todos os arquivos .php e .js, todos os arquivos block.json, e os arquivos readme.txt, readme.md, style.css e theme.json do seu cartafol principal. Úsanse para atopar o texto que hai que traducir e para identificar o plugin ou tema."

